{"metadata":{"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"mfd-cat"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"合集"},3],"title":[{"Plain":"流形与高阶范畴"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>本页是单纯百科上流形与高阶范畴的百科页面、笔记和参考文献的合集.</p>\n<h2>分解同调与配边</h2>\n<p>主要的参考文献是 Ayala–Francis(–Rozenblyum) 的系列文章.</p>\n<h3>$\\mathbb E_n$-代数的分解同调</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>百科页面: "},{"Local":{"url":"En-代数","text":"$\\mathbb E_n$-代数"}},{"Plain":", "},{"Local":{"url":"分解同调","text":"分解同调"}},{"Plain":"</li>\n<li>参考文献: "},{"Local":{"url":"AyalaFrancisFact","text":"Ayala–Francis, Factorization homology of topological manifolds"}},{"Plain":"</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>分层流形</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>百科页面: "},{"Local":{"url":"分层","text":"分层"}},{"Plain":"</li>\n<li>相关笔记: "},{"Local":{"url":"strat-cat","text":"分层空间与范畴"}},{"Plain":"</li>\n<li>参考文献: "},{"Local":{"url":"AyalaFrancisRozenblyumStrat","text":"Ayala–Francis–Rozenblyum, A stratified homotopy hypothesis"}},{"Plain":"</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>$(\\infty,n)$-范畴的分解同调</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>参考文献: "},{"Local":{"url":"AyalaFrancisRozenblyumI","text":"Ayala–Francis–Rozenblyum, Factorization homology I: higher categories"}},{"Plain":"</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>配边假设与缠结假设</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>百科页面: "},{"Local":{"url":"配边假设","text":"配边假设"}},{"Plain":", "},{"Local":{"url":"缠结假设","text":"缠结假设"}},{"Plain":", "},{"Local":{"url":"cob-sing","text":null}},{"Plain":"</li>\n<li>参考文献: "},{"Local":{"url":"AyalaFrancisCob","text":"Ayala–Francis, The cobordism hypothesis"}},{"Plain":"</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>线图与流形图</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"HeidemannMfdDiag","text":"Lukas Heidemann 的博士论文"}},{"Plain":"引入了流形图, 推广了"},{"Local":{"url":"线图","text":"线图"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<ul>\n<li>百科页面: "},{"Local":{"url":"线图","text":"线图"}},{"Plain":"</li>\n<li>相关笔记: "},{"Local":{"url":"notes-manifold-diagrams","text":"高阶范畴的流形图示"}},{"Plain":"</li>\n<li>参考文献: "},{"Local":{"url":"HeidemannMfdDiag","text":"Heidemann, Manifold Diagrams for Higher Categories"}},{"Plain":"</li>\n</ul>\n"}]}}